Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it, gotta go over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing, no time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Marks maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.46,0:02:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd lost hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet here you are before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And all it took was 13 years of\Npoisonous fish, day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see your face, Kawamatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, I am bound by chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When will the battle occur?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine days from now, on the\Nnight of the fire festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what delicious irony, taking Kaido's\Nhead in the celebration meant to honor him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to ask this, but could\Nyou please free me from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.12,0:02:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see to it post-haste, though\NI'm faced with several obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.54,0:03:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need the keys to\Nyour cell and your chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us hope they aren't\Ntoo rusted to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone in front\Nof the forbidden cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His head is massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's got to be the key thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We found the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Solitaire, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Un-key!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture him, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoke escaped Jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be a ninja! Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.14,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we have enough guards going\Nafter the key thief right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now escort these gentlemen\Nto their execution. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Master Queen's special device\Nperformance, the Sumo Inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This collar here is the same as\Nthe ones you got around your necks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.56,0:04:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine this stone pillar is one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what happens if you try\Nto leave the ring with your collar on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So before trying anything naughty,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:05:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you should know that these\Ncollars are equipped with blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,strong enough to cut through stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Or in this case, your\Nlittle necks. No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like what the Celestial Dragons used!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,kid, but you really think you can\Npull the thing off just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep winning matches, and your head\Ngets to stay attached to your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But step out of the\Nring and you're a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are a team, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,so the execution isn't complete until\Nboth of you fall out of the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, if you change your\Nmind and decide to join us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,then Straw Hat and only\NStraw Hat will be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As for your opponents, they'll have\Nweapons, no collars, and limitless numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep them coming\Nfor as long as I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll do you one favor,\Njust to make things more fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's uncuff you, boys, so\Nyou don't die in round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the trouble I went through?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this the wrong key?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So the mission was a\Nbust from the very start?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a bad guy,\Nbut you're actually pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With those dumb cuffs off,\NI'm practically free already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.03,0:06:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just put something\Neven worse on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget you're wearing a\Ncollar that can chop your head off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If the two of us have to fight as\Na team, then I'll only hold Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you execute us separately?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't provoke him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If I kick your round ass hard enough,\Nwill you let us out of this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the bastard\Nwho stole my sword, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking it back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one who\Nstole that sacred blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have reclaimed Shusui and returned\Nit to the only place that it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That flamed sword is a\Nnational treasure that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,was taken from the grave of\Nthe legendary samurai, Ryuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then shut your mouth and leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do not, I will gladly steal\Nthe two swords at your waist as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You a weapon collector or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite a haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, my friends could put\Nthose weapons to good use right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky timing, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you think stealing is fair game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have fled while you\Nhad the chance, mountain bandit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but there seems\Nto be a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To be clear, I'm a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.84,0:08:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm going to enjoy crushing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll learn soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:09:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple of rounds and\Nhe'll beg for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules are completely stacked against\Nhim, and he's too stupid to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks this is a tournament\Nwhen it's an execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, men, start lining up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You all get your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Deathmatch, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there's too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only do we outnumber you,\Nwe're all armed to the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to follow any rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it starting to sink in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before\Nboth of you are chopped to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.35,0:09:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace, old man, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace, Mr. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:09:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Positions ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You prisoners are lucky to get\Na front row seat to the murder
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.74,0:10:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,show better behave or it'll be\Nyou up here next Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep them coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys weren't even\Na good enough warm-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't even touch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.62,0:10:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So he can use the Conqueror's Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:10:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time to up the ante.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasures!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your time to shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been an uproar every\Nday since you showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you can protect Yoguro,\Nthat's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Lufitaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.02,0:11:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a headliner from the Beast Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No one moves an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What could you want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A bathhouse is perfect for\Nour job today If everyone's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,naked that means they can't\Nhide anything from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Drake, get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.02,0:12:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing of interest\Nto me in the bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My job is to take down Sabo Mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do the rest of the\Ndirty work on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do, Shinobu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If they sent in someone like Hawkins,\Nthen they must be here for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they know where to find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.24,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those cheaters, literally\Ncatching us with our pants down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep that as a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A mature woman doesn't use\Nher weapons carelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide behind me, ladies, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I want everyone here to line up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us your ankles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of you have a reversed\Ncrescent moon tattoo,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'm afraid you'll\Nneed to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:13:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone soaking in the bath\Nmust step out immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Check them all. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the plan get leaked?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.18,0:13:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that hiding behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll back you\Nup if something happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, did you mean\Nme? I wasn't hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a normal customer\Ntaking a hot bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's dynamite!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Her body's a national treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A deadly art.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.64,0:14:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A happy punch straight to my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandits, a knockout!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's the guy from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Soap mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The shape of your body was like a\Nmagnificent river flowing through heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.26,0:14:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanchi, what is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is he wearing, that idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Drake, is silver mask inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He was there all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, bring me silver mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:15:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're that weak to naked women, then\Nyou should have informed me beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who you calling weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Drake, you're originally from\Nthe North Blue, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same as you. What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then look, that man should seem familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.22,0:15:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealth black from Germa double six!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But Al, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare run from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The search isn't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You filler!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm afraid of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out, Sabo Mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he has\Nteleportation tech as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:15:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's flying! Follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Stealth Black could\Nhave pulled that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get him next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna explain yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you once we're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bleeding. Profusely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die now, I die happy. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the least of our concerns now that\Nthey've found out about the ankle tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.74,0:16:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.66,0:16:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we have a traitor\Nin our midst. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.08,0:16:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard some more bad news\Nbefore I went to the bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Beppo, Penguin, and\NChouchou were taken captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Beast Pirates must\Nbe aiming for Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They nabbed his friends to\Nuse his bait to lure him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.24,0:16:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, it's likely\Ntheir plan will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be a grump, but\Nhe cares about his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll try to stop him for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to throw\Nthe capital into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:17:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't told us why\Nyou were at the bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer till I get my yummy treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.50,0:17:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pass out soon if I don't eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Chuck Raymond, I\Nwould love a little snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're giving me that look again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be too much longer, Olene!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we say big bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,After that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm something big!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.10,0:17:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you also enjoy a bowl with me, Otama?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.59,0:17:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Otsuru gave me some on my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like it was dancing inside my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:18:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a happiness spread all the way\Nfrom my head down to my tippy toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought my ginger bubble exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Red beans are such a delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Red bean paste, don't let\Nit go to waste. Ah-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Rice cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Best friends with red beans!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Together they make the\Nmost deliciousest treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.46,0:18:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet that you can't name a Tsuru bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.03,0:18:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And the way the little pieces of mochi\Nshine like a frog's eye, it's collectible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, like a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't eat eyeballs, do you, Olene?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just pointing out the similarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Though almost anything\Nlooks good, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not edible! Stop! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't get it, I'll go mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're rather excited over this meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:18:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your certainness is okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know anymore. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I must stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen when she\Nfinds out there is no Oshiruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the devastating truth gonna\Nshock her back into being big mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,STRIKE!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to make the rescue\Nmission even more dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Another survey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy Toto wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.86,0:20:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.44,0:20:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You took down all the pleasures with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, almost?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.04,0:20:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You wiped the floor with those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get how Rayleigh does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think, like this, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, it's called armament Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it as covering\Nyourself in invisible armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:21:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I watched Rayleigh send an elephant\Nflying without even touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the first time he showed me Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been insanely strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.18,0:21:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to learn how to use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.60,0:21:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is taking too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me get in there already, I'll\Nkill that little punk in ten seconds flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What would be the fun in that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumo Inferno's at its best\Nwhen it's dragged out. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'll break it down for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The more people involved,\Nthe longer the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The longer the fight,\Nthe more the suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole production\Nis about crushing his
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,spirit slowly but surely until he croaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here with that efficiency crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Which you clearly don't\Nknow the first thing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.22,0:21:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go and fetch me more?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Another?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.82,0:21:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, haven't you had enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow it down Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.60,0:22:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than just food.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like air to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.86,0:22:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what impeccable time\Nis exactly what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.56,0:22:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my all-time favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.10,0:22:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Supreee-me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.38,0:22:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Send him flying with my invisible armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll figure it out somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.19,0:22:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually met with Yuma, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.14,0:22:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you claim is impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.12,0:23:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I would fall\Nfor such an obvious ruse?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.66,0:23:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I saw his body, the\Nsoul was someone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you've lost your mind to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You know nothing of Ryuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.86,0:23:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a legendary swordsman,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,able to take down any opponents\Nin the blink of an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.74,0:23:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an ingrate, incapable of\Nunderstanding the greatness of Shusui!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That blade is a treasure to the\Npeople here, IT BELONGS TO REYUMON!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Many years ago, the world once\Nreferred to our beloved country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.36,0:23:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,as the Land of Gold. Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.66,0:23:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're open!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates across the world lusted\Nafter the wealth of our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:23:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And the world nobles too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.08,0:24:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They longed to rule over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.32,0:24:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there was only one man who stood\Nup to the avaricious enemies from abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.56,0:24:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He burned the name of our samurai\Ninto the pages of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.38,0:24:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That man was our hero, Ryuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.24,0:24:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Many legends surround his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However, one in particular\Nis the most famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.84,0:24:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tale of him slaying a dragon\Nthat once flew over the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.56,0:24:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon his death, he was laid to rest\Nwith his trusted weapon, Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.30,0:24:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He was consecrated as God of the Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.82,0:24:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryuma and Chouchou belong\Nto the people of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.30,0:25:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You made your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, none of that's\Ngot anything to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.68,0:25:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to take back Shusui.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.54,0:25:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel off my game\Nswinging around two swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.62,0:25:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems as if I have overestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.30,0:25:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shusui is a black blade It is Ryumas You\Nare not the one who forged it in battle
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.40,0:25:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a swordsman like he was You're
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.36,0:25:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,just a hoodlum With no\Nintegrity to speak of
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.40,0:25:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Forged?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.48,0:25:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering about that
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.28,0:25:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.08,0:25:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.99,0:25:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're open!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.82,0:25:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.66,0:26:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stab me in the back when\Nsomeone is crying for help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.90,0:26:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought I wouldn't take\Nadvantage of an opening?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.80,0:26:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a fight to the death I will win!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.92,0:26:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.62,0:26:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives are in danger! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.52,0:26:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.14,0:26:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.05,0:26:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.62,0:26:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.18,0:26:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The laughing is throwing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.94,0:26:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.85,0:26:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Swordsman, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.84,0:26:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.94,0:26:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.82,0:26:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.73,0:26:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess they're serious after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.84,0:27:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,One second, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.12,0:27:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're open!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.22,0:27:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.52,0:27:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.43,0:27:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you take a hint, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.10,0:27:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We are still in a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.00,0:27:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not finished with you yet! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.90,0:27:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fight, but give me a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.12,0:27:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You think everyone forgot about\Nthe murder you committed, Zorojuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.52,0:28:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a question, what\Ncompels you to help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.72,0:28:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.86,0:28:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have a beef with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.76,0:28:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here for one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.42,0:28:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to cut down that little brat who\Nlaughed at the shogun and ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.70,0:28:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Dock. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.50,0:28:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yojito Kirikamazo, the serial\Nkiller from the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.12,0:28:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's clear you're actually an\Nassassin that works for Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.88,0:28:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else would have reason to come after\Na harmless young girl's life like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.00,0:28:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The nerve of you addressing the\NShogun without his proper title.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.22,0:28:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an interesting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.76,0:28:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.80,0:28:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a samurai, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.68,0:28:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.88,0:28:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, lucky for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.30,0:28:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly the type of man to watch a
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.20,0:28:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,woman and a kid get\Nslaughtered before my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.56,0:28:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything to pay you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.46,0:29:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll call it even for a meal and sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.84,0:29:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.82,0:29:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.76,0:29:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me, I was already granted permission\Nto dismantle anyone who gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.36,0:29:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'm gonna catch hell from your\Nboss, but I'm kicking your ass either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry—you'll be dead before\Nyou can even catch your breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.16,0:29:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,breath
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.16,0:30:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time you got serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.16,0:31:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky I don't have my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.80,0:31:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This would be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.96,0:31:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm unbearably hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.98,0:32:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that maybe,\Nif I'm all a meal good,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I could get dibs on a\Nstash of prison dumplings?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.54,0:32:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.80,0:32:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Show him who's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.08,0:32:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the positivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.28,0:32:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get him. You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.66,0:32:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.70,0:32:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.82,0:32:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But that barely hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.22,0:32:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.44,0:32:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.54,0:32:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he looks quite\Ncuddly on the exterior.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.80,0:32:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But keep in mind the bear's\Nclaws are powerful enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.60,0:32:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,to tear through human\Nflesh like it's paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.00,0:32:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.16,0:32:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.46,0:32:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No contact!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.06,0:33:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.16,0:33:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep accidentally hitting them!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.96,0:33:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.34,0:33:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't hitting them the whole point?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.68,0:33:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.74,0:33:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Send in more!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.60,0:33:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.54,0:33:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.60,0:33:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.48,0:33:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.50,0:34:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Brad!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.74,0:34:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Brad!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.06,0:34:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't pull it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you don't mind if\NI borrow this for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.30,0:35:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.64,0:35:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to use three weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.38,0:35:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.48,0:35:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Purgatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.94,0:35:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.36,0:36:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.14,0:36:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What strength! Stunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.48,0:36:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.48,0:36:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I really have to do this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.48,0:37:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.64,0:37:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
